<div class="media-body">


<h4 class="media-heading">Coach "Ru" Reaches Milestone</h4>


Steve Ruzich, South Suburban College head baseball coach for the last 35 years, won his 1,200th baseball game on March 20th, picking up the 8-6 victory against Carl Sandburg.

<a class="btn btn-default" role="button" href="https://www.ssc.edu/hall-of-fame-baseball-coach-steve-ruzich-wins-1200th-game/">Read More</a>

