							<div class="row">
								<div class="col-md-6">
									<h2>About</h2>
<p>The Bulldogs have claimed 16 Division I, NJCAA Region IV Titles. (1991, 2002, 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2021, 2022, 2023, and 2026).</p>
<p>The team plays a fall schedule of scrimmage games and begins their official season on January 10.</p>
<p>The team <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">fundraises each year to travel to </span>Texas to play some of the strongest JUCO teams in the nation.</p>
<p>They are coached by Steve Ruzich who is in his 41st year at SSC. Over that time span, Coach Ruzich has compiled a winning record of <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">1427</span><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody"> wins and 833 losses</span>. Coach Ruzich was also inducted into the NJCAA baseball coaches Hall of Fame in May of 2014. <a href="mailto:sruzich@ssc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-envelope-o"></i> &#8220;Coach Ru&#8221;</a> can be contacted at (708) 596-2000, ext. 5843.</p>
 
								</div>
